  "solution": "According to BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation **(38 A 17) B 9 C 117 D 13 E 94 = 104 **\n\n**Option 1: Using the combination **+, ÷, ×, +, - \n\n(38 + 17) ÷ 9 × 117 + 13 - 94 = 104 \n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n55 ÷ 9 × 117 + 13 - 94 = 104\n\n6.12 × 117 + 13 - 94 = 104\n\n715 + 13 - 94 = 104\n\n728 - 94 = 104\n\n634 = 104 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 2:** Using combination ×, -, ÷, +, - \n\n(38 × 17) - 9 ÷ 117 + 13 - 94 = 104\n\n646 - 9 ÷ 117 + 13 - 94 = 104\n\n646 – 0.076 + 13 - 94 = 104\n\n659 – 94.076 = 104 \n\n564.924 = 104 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 3: Using the combination **-, ×, +, ÷, - \n\n**(38 - 17) × 9 + 117 ÷ 13 - 94 = 104**\n\n**21 × 9 + 117 ÷ 13 - 94 = 104 **\n\n**21 × 9 + 9 - 94 = 104**\n\n**189 + 9 - 94 = 104 **\n\n**198 - 94 = 104**\n\n**104 = 104** **(LHS = RHS)**\n\n**Option 4:** Using the combination ×, ÷, +, -, -\n\n(38 × 17) ÷ 9 + 117 - 13 - 94 = 104\n\n1666 ÷ 9 + 117 - 13 - 94 = 104\n\n185.12 + 117 - 13 - 94 = 104 \n\n302.12 - 107 = 104\n\n195.12 = 104 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, the answer is **“****-, ×, +, ÷, -”.**",
